# NAME: WeChat
# AUTHOR: KnowSky404
# UPDATED: 2026-11-06
# SOURCE: Original: https://microbin.knowsky.uk/raw/bqWQ3e; blackmatrix7 WeChat: https://github.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script/blob/0fa60782abfe70f58da510e90d9086136cf0d855/rule/Loon/WeChat/WeChat.list
# NOTE: All clients retain the original 31 domain/IP predicates. Loon additionally uses two User-Agent patterns and AS132203 from blackmatrix7; QX/sing-box retain the original scope. Private-IP routing and policy remain in consumer configuration.

# Original IP range
# The full supplied range is retained; it is not exclusive to WeChat.
# Migration uses the repository's no-pre-resolution contract; the original route rule did not encode no-resolve.
# QX's third-field no-resolve is a compatibility policy token, not a DNS switch; set filter_remote force-policy.
IP-CIDR,43.160.0.0/12,no-resolve

# Original exact domains
# Shared service endpoints are retained exactly as supplied, without expanding them to suffixes.
DOMAIN,apd-pcdnwxlogin.teg.tencent-cloud.net
DOMAIN,btrace.qq.com
DOMAIN,dldir1.qq.com
DOMAIN,slife.xy-asia.com
DOMAIN,soup.v.qq.com
DOMAIN,vweixinf.tc.qq.com
DOMAIN,weixin110.qq.com
DOMAIN,wup.imtt.qq.com

# Original domain suffixes
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,iot-tencent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,lbs.gtimg.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,map.qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,qlogo.cn
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,qpic.cn
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,servicewechat.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tenpay.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,up-hl.3g.qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,vweixinthumb.tc.qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wechat.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wechatlegal.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wechatos.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wechatpay.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,weixin.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,weixin.qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,weixinbridge.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,weixinsxy.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wx.gtimg.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wx.qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wxapp.tc.qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wxs.qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,yun-hl.3g.qq.com

# Loon additions from blackmatrix7
# Checked 2026-11-06: all 8 exact domains and 22 suffixes already match upstream, in order.
# Upstream author: blackmatrix7; license: GPL-2.0, https://github.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script/blob/0fa60782abfe70f58da510e90d9086136cf0d855/LICENSE
# These additions are intentionally Loon-only; QX retains the original scope by request, not because it lacks these rule types.
# sing-box Source Rule Set v2 has no User-Agent or ASN predicates; no dynamic ASN-to-CIDR expansion is performed.
# User-Agent matches visible HTTP request headers, not all traffic from the app.
# AS132203 is a shared Tencent network, not WeChat-exclusive; it is not equivalent to 43.160.0.0/12.
USER-AGENT,MicroMessenger*
USER-AGENT,WeChat*
IP-ASN,132203,no-resolve
